### 4. 批量删除API接口
DELETE {{prefix}}/test/sysApi
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[123456,1234567]

### 5. 根据ID查询API接口
GET {{prefix}}/test/sysApi/1234567
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 6. 批量ID查询API接口
POST {{prefix}}/test/sysApi/findByIds
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[1234567]

### 7. 根据URI查询API接口
GET {{prefix}}/test/sysApi/findByUri?uri=/api/train/bogie-data
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 8. 根据方法和URI查询API
GET {{prefix}}/test/sysApi/findByMethodAndUri?apiMethod=POST&apiUri=/api/train/bogie-data
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 9. 获取全部API接口
GET {{prefix}}/test/sysApi/all
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 10. 批量方法+URI查询
POST {{prefix}}/test/sysApi/findByMethodAndUris
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "apiMethod": "GET",
    "apiUri": "/auth/code/image"
  },
  {
    "apiMethod": "POST",
    "apiUri": "/api/train/bogie-data"
  }
]

### 11. 批量URI查询
POST {{prefix}}/test/sysApi/findByUris
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  "/auth/code/image",
  "/api/train/bogie-data"
]

